The four stylesheets in this directory are the XSLT 2 implementation of ISO Schematron
("the skeleton"), 2010 release, by Rick Jelliffe with the Academia Sinica Computing
Centre, Taiwan. Each file carries the following notice at its head, with the copyright
line given below for that file.

  iso_dsdl_include.xsl                    Copyright (c) 2008-2010 Rick Jelliffe
  iso_abstract_expand.xsl                 Copyright (c) 2004-2010 Rick Jellife and
                                          Academia Sinica Computing Centre, Taiwan
  iso_svrl_for_xslt2.xsl                  Copyright (c) 2004-2010 Rick Jellife and
                                          Academia Sinica Computing Centre, Taiwan
  iso_schematron_skeleton_for_saxon.xsl   Copyright (c) 2000-2010 Rick Jellife and
                                          Academia Sinica Computing Centre, Taiwan.

