The copies were taken from the artefact com.helger.schematron:ph-schematron-xslt:8.0.6
of Maven Central, which carries them under external/schematron/20100710-xslt2/. That
artefact is published by Philip Helger under the Apache License, Version 2.0, whose
text is the LICENSE at the root of this repository, and its NOTICE reads:

  This product includes Open Source Software developed by
  Philip Helger - https://www.helger.com/

  This product includes Open Source Software developed by phloc systems (http://www.phloc.com/)

Seven places in the four files carry a comment beginning with [ph]: the changes made in
that copy. Four raise a version from 1.0 to 2.0 (of three of the stylesheets and of the
stylesheet the skeleton generates), one corrects the parameter of a template call, one
adjusts the context expression of the generated rules and one generates a parameter
where the original generated a variable. The files here are that copy, byte for byte.
